.TH EUCLID-CLI-ENS-PURGE-ALL-TOPIC 1 "August 2026" "euclid-cli 1.0.33" "Euclid CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
euclid-cli-ens-purge-all-topic \- delete all messages from every topic in a region/account
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B euclid-cli ens purge-all-topic
.BR \-\-region | \-r
.I REGION
.BR \-\-accountId | \-a
.I ACCOUNT-ID
[\fB\-\-namespace\fR|\fB\-n\fR \fINAMESPACE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Deletes all messages from every topic in the given region and account.
If
.B \-\-namespace
is given, only topics in that namespace are purged; otherwise every
topic in the region/account is purged regardless of namespace. No topic
is deleted, only its messages. This cannot be undone.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-region " " \fIREGION\fR
Region whose topics should be purged. Required.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-accountId " " \fIACCOUNT-ID\fR
Account ID whose topics should be purged. Required.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-namespace " " \fINAMESPACE\fR
Only purge topics in this namespace. Optional; if omitted, all
namespaces are purged.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Every matching topic's messages were deleted. No output is printed.
.TP
.B 1
Missing/invalid arguments or the server could not be reached.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
euclid-cli --endpoint http://localhost:5566 ens purge-all-topic \e
    --region eu-central-1 --accountId 000000000000

euclid-cli --endpoint http://localhost:5566 ens purge-all-topic \e
    --region eu-central-1 --accountId 000000000000 --namespace production
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR euclid-cli-ens (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-purge-topic (1)
